  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Khan Bank Green Bond Investment Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an eligible transaction under the Enhanced Faster Approach to Small Nonsovereign Transactions framework. The transaction involves an investment of up to $20,000,000 in Khan Bank JSC (KHB) for the Khan Bank Green Bond Investment Project in Mongolia. The project will help promote (i) domestic capital markets through the first green thematic bond issue listed on the MSE, (ii) affordable green investment financing across Mongolia, and (iii) women borrowers&apos; access to green finance.</narrative>
  </description>
